            %p
              and let the connecting homomorphism be as in def.
              = succeed "." do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#ConnectinHomomorphismForCohomologyTheoryOnInfinityCategory"}
          .num_prop
            %h6#proposition_5 Proposition
            %p
              The construction in def.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#ReducedToUnreducedGeneralizedCohomology"}
              indeed yields an unreduced cohomology theory.
          %p
            e.g. (
            %a{:href => "#Switzer75"}> Switzer 75, 7.35
